        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5059LSKN,  L-Square Knurled Lever with Round Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe epitome of modernity: the Knurled Lever with Disk Rose. This sleek lever set features a textured handle and a stunning round Disk rosette, elevating the aesthetics of any standard door. Available in an array of contemporary finish colors, you can customize it to suit your personal style. The L-Square Knurled Lever with Round Disk Rosette comes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions, offering versatility for both interior and exterior doors. With its compatibility with most standard pre-drilled doors, installation is a breeze. Experience the perfect blend of style and functionality with this modern knurled leverset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSKN-specifications.gif?v=1704354573\" width=\"600\" height=\"161\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Knurled Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the L-Square Knurled Door Lever with Disk Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Knurled  L-Square Leverset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSKN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262373\"><b>Emtek Knurled Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Knurled Lever with Disk Rose",
                "description": "The epitome of modernity: the Knurled Lever with Disk Rose. This sleek lever set features a textured handle and a stunning round Disk rosette, elevating the aesthetics of any standard door. Available in an array of contemporary finish colors, you can customize it to suit your personal style. The L-Square Knurled Lever with Round Disk Rosette comes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions, offering versatility for both interior and exterior doors. With its compatibility with most standard pre-drilled doors, installation is a breeze. Experience the perfect blend of style and functionality with this modern knurled leverset.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Knurled L-Square Leverset with Round Roses, L-Square Knurled Door Lever with Disk Roses, Knurled Lever with Disk Roses,  L-Square Knurled Lever with Disk Roses, EMT-5059LSKN,  L-Square Knurled Lever with Round Disk Rosettes, modern levers, Textured Knurled Levers, emtek 5109LSKN passage levers, emtek 5209LSKN privacy levers, emtek 5059LSKN dummy levers,"
